      "content": "SP 8607, SP 8707           WENDOVER              AYLESBURY ROAD                                                  east side 10/190 11/190                                           Nos. 4 & 6 The George                                                  Public House (formerly 25.10.51                                         listed as The George Inn) GV                                               II Public House. C18 altered C19. Painted stucco over brick. Old tile roof, raised in height, so that tall central brick stack with band course is on the front slope. 2 storeys. 2 sash windows 4 panes wide in reveals to 1st floor. 2 early C19 canted bay windows to ground floor flanking central 6-panel door (2 rows of 3 panels) under flat cornice hood on cut brackets. Wrought iron sign holder with scroll ornament. Listing NGR: SP8697307920"
    }
